      "statement": "Florida water underwriting is source-driven: sewer, drain, or sump backup must be distinguished from flood, surface water, exterior entry, repeated seepage, leakage, and maintenance conditions; unresolved or recurring water conditions, unsupported remediation, inoperative protection, and requested water-backup limits above $10,000 require referral.",
